---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const SITE_NAME = import.meta.env.SITE_NAME || "Site Name";
---

<Layout
  title={`${SITE_NAME} - Privacy Policy`}
  description={`${SITE_NAME} - Privacy Policy`}
  keywords={`${SITE_NAME}, ${SITE_NAME} privacy policy`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mx-3 prose max-w-none prose-invert p-8">
      <div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not collect personal information, create user accounts, or build
          user profiles. However, our servers may temporarily generate basic
          technical logs such as IP address, browser type, device information,
          and requested pages. These logs are used strictly for security,
          maintenance, and performance monitoring, and are not connected to any
          identifiable individual.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising Partners</h2>
        <p>
          Our website displays advertisements served by third-party advertising
          networks. These partners may use technologies like cookies or device
          identifiers to deliver relevant ads and measure performance. Any data
          they collect is governed by their own privacy policies. We do not
          control, access, or store this information.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use analytics or tracking cookies on our site. However,
          third-party advertisers may place cookies or similar technologies on
          your device. You can manage or disable cookies through your browser
          settings, though doing so may impact the relevance of displayed
          advertisements.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our platform may include links to external websites and streaming
          sources. We are not responsible for the content, security, or privacy
          practices of these third-party sites. We recommend reviewing their
          policies before interacting with them or sharing any information.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We implement reasonable technical measures to protect the limited
          system data generated by our servers. While we strive to safeguard
          information, no method of transmission or storage over the internet is
          completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This website is intended for users aged 18 and above. We do not
          knowingly collect or store personal information from individuals under
          this age.
        </p>

        <h2>Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will
          be reflected on this page. Continued use of the site after changes are
          posted indicates your acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please
          contact us through our contact page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
